      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63385",
      ":question/problem": "A bank has created a list of customers with various balances in their bank accounts. The data is shown below.\n\n| Customer | Bank Balance |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Mr. Jones | $- $329$ |\n| Ms. Chin | $$16$ |\n| Ms. Hernandez | $$1256$ |\n| Mr. Pulev | $- $67$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. Mr. Jones owes $$329$ to the bank.\n2. Ms. Chin has the lowest bank balance.\n3. Mr. Pulev owes less money to the bank than Ms. Chin."
    },
