      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-93568",
      ":question/problem": "Four people are walking along a well-known trekking route. The table below shows each person's position, represented as the distance walked since passing a resting area.\n\n| Person | Distance (m) |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Spencer | $400$ |\n| Emelia | $-150$ |\n| Isadore | $600$ |\n| Suz | $-800$ |\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n1. Spencer is $400m$ before reaching the resting area.\n2. Isadore has walked farther past the resting area than Spencer.\n3. Emelia is closer to the resting area than Suz."
    }
